# .gitignore for a .NET Solution

## Build Folders
bin/
obj/

## User-Specific Files
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.vs
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

## Logs and Debugging
*.log
*.tlog

## IDE Directories
.idea/
.vs/

## Temporary Files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.cache
*.pdb
*.pidb

## Generated Files
*.dll
*.exe
*.app
*.pdb
*.cache
*.stackdump

## Test Results
TestResults/

## Dependency Folders
node_modules/

## Configuration Files
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
zenith.yml
# Docker sample must be in git (Dokploy/clone); missing bind-mount → Docker makes a directory.
!deploy/zenith.yml

## Publish Output
publish/

## JetBrains Rider
.idea/

## macOS Specific
.DS_Store

## Windows Specific
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Other System Files
*.swp
*.lock
tmp-log.txt
worlds/
deploy/worlds/
deploy/data/zenith.yml
deploy/data/worlds/
docker-compose.override.yml
.cursor/*
!.cursor/skills/
!.cursor/skills/**/
!.cursor/rules/
!.cursor/rules/**/

artifacts/
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
**/zenith.Benchmarks-*/
tmp-nbt-dump.csx
tools/protocol-import/.cache/
